Relevant columns and how they will be used  
• `borough` : filter rows to only Westminster ( `WHERE borough = 'Westminster'` )  
• `major_category` : filter to Theft and Handling ( `WHERE major_category = 'Theft and Handling'` )  
• `minor_category` : filter to Other Theft ( `WHERE minor_category = 'Other Theft'` )  
• `value` : the incident count to be summed ( `SUM(value)` )  
• `year` : group‑by field so we get a yearly total ( `GROUP BY year` )  

